      {
        "name": "أَفْرَادُ الْأُسْرَةِ فِي الْقُرْآنِ",
        "nameEn": "Family members in the Quran",
        "color": "yellow",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "أَبَتِ",
            "en": "O my father",
            "ref": "19:44",
            "verse": "يَـٰٓأَبَتِ لَا تَعْبُدِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنَ ۖ إِنَّ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنَ كَانَ لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ عَصِيًّۭا",
            "verseEn": "O my father, do not worship [i.e., obey] Satan. Indeed Satan has ever been, to the Most Merciful, disobedient."
          },
          {
            "ar": "أُمِّهِ",
            "en": "And his mother",
            "ref": "80:35",
            "verse": "وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ",
            "verseEn": "And his mother and his father"
          },
          {
            "ar": "أَخِيهِ",
            "en": "and his brother",
            "ref": "12:89",
            "verse": "قَالَ هَلْ عَلِمْتُم مَّا فَعَلْتُم بِيُوسُفَ وَأَخِيهِ إِذْ أَنتُمْ جَـٰهِلُونَ",
            "verseEn": "He said, \"Do you know what you did with Joseph and his brother when you were ignorant?\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْبَنَاتِ",
            "en": "daughters",
            "ref": "16:57",
            "verse": "وَيَجْعَلُونَ لِلَّهِ ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ وَلَهُم مَّا يَشْتَهُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And they attribute to Allāh daughters - exalted is He - and for them is what they desire [i.e., sons]."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَحْدَاثُ يَوْمِ الْقِيَامَةِ فِي سُورَةِ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "nameEn": "Events of the Day of Judgment in Surah An-Nazi'at",
        "color": "green",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "الرَّادِفَةُ",
            "en": "the subsequent",
            "ref": "79:7",
            "verse": "تَتْبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ",
            "verseEn": "There will follow it the subsequent [one]."
          },
          {
            "ar": "السَّاهِرَةِ",
            "en": "(will be) awakened",
            "ref": "79:14",
            "verse": "فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ",
            "verseEn": "And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface."
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْمَأْوَىٰ",
            "en": "(is) the refuge",
            "ref": "79:39",
            "verse": "فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ",
            "verseEn": "Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge."
          },
          {
            "ar": "عَشِيَّةً",
            "en": "an evening",
            "ref": "79:46",
            "verse": "كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓا۟ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَىٰهَا",
            "verseEn": "It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَلْفَاظٌ خَاصَّةٌ بِالْكَافِرِينَ فِي سُورَةِ الْمُلْكِ",
        "nameEn": "Distinctive terms for the disbelievers in Surah Al-Mulk",
        "color": "blue",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "يَخْسِفَ",
            "en": "He will cause to swallow",
            "ref": "67:16",
            "verse": "ءَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يَخْسِفَ بِكُمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ فَإِذَا هِىَ تَمُورُ",
            "verseEn": "Do you feel secure that He who is above would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway?"
          },
          {
            "ar": "لَجُّوا",
            "en": "they persist",
            "ref": "67:21",
            "verse": "أَمَّنْ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى يَرْزُقُكُمْ إِنْ أَمْسَكَ رِزْقَهُۥ ۚ بَل لَّجُّوا۟ فِى عُتُوٍّۢ وَنُفُورٍ",
            "verseEn": "Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion."
          },
          {
            "ar": "مُكِبًّا",
            "en": "fallen",
            "ref": "67:22",
            "verse": "أَفَمَن يَمْشِى مُكِبًّا عَلَىٰ وَجْهِهِۦٓ أَهْدَىٰٓ أَمَّن يَمْشِى سَوِيًّا عَلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍۢ مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ",
            "verseEn": "Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path?"
          },
          {
            "ar": "يُجِيرُ",
            "en": "(can) protect",
            "ref": "67:28",
            "verse": "قُلْ أَرَءَيْتُمْ إِنْ أَهْلَكَنِىَ ٱللَّهُ وَمَن مَّعِىَ أَوْ رَحِمَنَا فَمَن يُجِيرُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ مِنْ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍۢ",
            "verseEn": "Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Have you considered: whether Allāh should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "مُفْرَدَاتٌ مِنْ سُورَةِ الْعَلَقِ",
        "nameEn": "Key Terms from Surah Al-Alaq",
